{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/extras/EN-01.png?t=1740542158\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/extras/01.gif?t=1740542158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in hand-illustrated fantasy world that draws you deeper into the story. Refuge of Embers follows the renamable main character Harth as the world he knows gives way to change that causes him to discover a deeper purpose. Harth lives a simple life with his friends in a remote frontier village. Events eventually lead him to Pyre, the enormous capital city where he encounters unusual new situations. How will Harth and his friends react to the strange new world they find themselves in? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/extras/EN-02.png?t=1740542158\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/extras/02.gif?t=1740542158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and romance a large cast of characters, each with their own distinct personalities, backgrounds, and motives. Forge deep connections with them as you navigate the complexities of their relationships. What will the characters you meet think of the choices you make, and how will that change your relationship with them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/extras/EN-03.png?t=1740542158\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/extras/03.gif?t=1740542158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With an intricate web of choices and consequences, unlock various endings that reflect the impact of your decisions. The decisions that you make may even lead to different flavors of endings with the same characters depending on how you choose to act around them. Replay the game to experience alternative storylines and unlock all possible outcomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/extras/EN-04.png?t=1740542158\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/extras/04.png?t=1740542158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the many mysteries and secrets scattered throughout the story to unveil more about the lore and background of the game. Character accessories, hidden messages, and even entire bonus scenes will await you as you find objects hidden throughout the game and explore menus. How many secrets will you find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/extras/EN-05.png?t=1740542158\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/extras/05.gif?t=1740542158\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easily enable or disable adult content at any time, including: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Impregnation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">X-Ray View </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Femdom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harem </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2175740?t=1740542158","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740542158","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175740/c78060f3813851282c893380c294087bb3e730e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17405421